-family="Helvetica" font-size="12px" text-anchor="middle">小鹅</text></switch></g></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="27"><g><rect x="1030" y="290" width="330" height="190" fill="none" stroke="none" pointer-events="all"/></g><g><g><switch><foreignObject style="overflow: visible; text-align: left;" pointer-events="none" width="100%" height="100%" requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: flex; align-items: unsafe flex-start; justify-content: unsafe flex-start; width: 328px; height: 1px; padding-top: 297px; margin-left: 1032px;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0; text-align: left; max-height: 186px; overflow: hidden; color: #000000; "><div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: light-dark(#000000, #ffffff); line-height: 1.2; pointer-events: all; white-space: normal; word-wrap: normal; "><h1 style="margin-top: 0px;">教学引导</h1><p>提示玩家右键点击农家少女用命令菜单或左键点击然后按下快捷键Q控制角色，进入微操模式</p><p>提示玩具用 wasd 控制角色移动，可以看到小鹅也受制于基因开始跟随。</p></div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="1032" y="309" fill="light-dark(#000000, #ffffff)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="12px">教学引导提示玩家右键点击农家少女用命令菜单或左键点击然后按下快捷键Q控制角色，进入微操模式...</text></switch></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="28"><g><rect x="1030" y="450" width="330" height="190" fill="none" stroke="none" pointer-events="all"/></g><g><g><switch><foreignObject style="overflow: visible; text-align: left;" pointer-events="none" width="100%" height="100%" requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: flex; align-items: unsafe flex-start; justify-content: unsafe flex-start; width: 328px; height: 1px; padding-top: 457px; margin-left: 1032px;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0; text-align: left; max-height: 186px; overflow: hidden; color: #000000; "><div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: light-dark(#000000, #ffffff); line-height: 1.2; pointer-events: all; white-space: normal; word-wrap: normal; "><h1 style="margin-top: 0px;">继续游戏</h1><p>提示玩家教程已经结束，可以继续用 wasd 移动探索场景</p><p>别的场景里有很多经过即会孵化的蛋，会开始跟随农家少女或者其它小鹅。</p><p>在地图隐藏的地下室里，也有一些异形卵，其默认行为是扑面并使角色倒地无法行动。</p></div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="1032" y="469" fill="light-dark(#000000, #ffffff)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="12px">继续游戏提示玩家教程已经结束，可以继续用 wasd 移动探索场景...</text></switch></g></g></g></g></g></g><switch><g requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility"/><a transform="translate(0,-5)" xlink:href="https://www.drawio.com/doc/faq/svg-export-text-problems" target="_blank"><text text-anchor="middle" font-size="10px" x="50%" y="100%">Text is not SVG - cannot display</text></a></switch></svg>